 gen<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw2\">false</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>test<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'['</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/any/any_cast\"><span class=\"kw1079\">std::<span class=\"me2\">any_cast</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view\"><span class=\"kw1256\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string_view</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>a<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"] \"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>[t] [e] [s] [t] \n[test]</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"References\">References</h3>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-c++23\">\n<ul><li> C++23 standard (ISO/IEC 14882:2024): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 26.5.6 Class template elements_of [range.elementsof] \n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Template parameters","id":"Template_parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Data members","id":"Data_members"},{"depth":3,"text":"Deduction guide","id":"Deduction_guide"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"References","id":"References"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"ranges","title":"Ranges library (since C++20)"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::ranges::elements_of","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Encapsulate